# Trivy Vulnerability Allowlist
#
# This file contains vulnerabilities that have been reviewed and accepted.
# Each entry must include:
# - CVE ID
# - Justification for acceptance
# - Expiry date (format: YYYY-MM-DD) for re-evaluation
# - Reviewer name/team
#
# Format:
# CVE-YYYY-NNNNN  # Justification | Expiry: YYYY-MM-DD | Reviewer: Name
#
# Example entries (remove when adding real entries):
# CVE-2024-12345  # No fix available in alpine:3.19; risk accepted as non-exploitable in our context | Expiry: 2026-12-31 | Reviewer: Security Team
# CVE-2024-67890  # False positive - not applicable to our usage | Expiry: 2026-06-30 | Reviewer: DevOps Team
#
